==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# (''in an internal combustion engine'') A valve through which the [[product]]s of [[combustion]] [[escape]] from the [[cylinder]] to the [[manifold]].
# {{q|in a steam engine}} A valve that allows [[steam]] to escape from a cylinder after use.

